---
/**
 * The hero's terminal window with a short `fbk` session. Lines wrap instead of
 * scrolling, so the window never shows a scrollbar.
 */
---

<figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-card-border bg-terminal shadow-2xl shadow-black/50">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-card-border px-4 py-3">
    <span class="flex gap-1.5" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/20"></span>
      <span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/20"></span>
      <span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-white/20"></span>
    </span>
    <figcaption class="font-mono text-xs text-muted-on-dark">
      ~/projects/webshop
    </figcaption>
  </div>
  <pre class="px-4 py-5 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed wrap-anywhere whitespace-pre-wrap text-text-on-dark"><span class="text-muted-on-dark">$</span> fbk start
<span class="text-muted-on-dark">Starting sandbox webshop...</span>
<span class="text-accent-dark">✓</span> Connect with: ssh webshop.fbk
<span class="text-muted-on-dark">$</span> fbk run claude
<span class="text-accent-dark">•</span> Agent is working in /workspaces/webshop.
<span class="text-accent-dark">•</span> Your host stays untouched. <span
  class="inline-block h-4 w-2 bg-accent-dark align-text-bottom"
  aria-hidden="true"></span></pre>
</figure>
